  "description": "Duk-Bong was desperate to find excitement in his lonely life, chasing rushes of joy until it lead him to steal a company flash drive from his own friend as a prank. Little did Duk-Bong know that this flash drive held the vilest secret of Korea’s richest tycoon. That one little flash drive nearly got Duk-Bong killed...and now that same flash drive is in the hands of a sadistic young streamer. But Duk-Bong doesn’t care! He’s still alive, and there’s much happiness to be found.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
